    "body": "Turned back to draft to push (UMA): merged main to resolve conflicts. No textual conflict locally; GitHub flagged the PR's app->sim move of boundary_arc_walls.rs. Main's new `VerifyContext::model_excess` (#864) needed one test-literal line in `boundary_arc_planes.rs` (b53d75a4). The new arc reading already compares against `cx.tightened(cx.gouge_tol)` in section.rs, so coarse-model tightening applies to it. Targeted gate on b53d75a4: sim, motion, app suites green, clippy -D warnings on camcraft-sim clean. Ready for a re-check (/resolve-conflicts check): merge-of-main delta + one test line.",
